# cultivation — soil_tired: translucent degradation overlay rendered by mod code as a
# flat quad on vanilla farmland's top face. Full-bleed 16x16, mostly transparent
# (~84%); three thin meandering 1px dry cracks in pale loam with semi-transparent
# alpha so the farmland texture shows through. Tiles seamlessly: the horizontal crack
# exits the right edge at row 4 and re-enters the left edge at row 4; the vertical
# crack exits the bottom at column 10 and re-enters the top at column 10. Code-bound
# (not on the block atlas), so no outline and no margin.
size: 16
kind: particle
ships: src/main/resources/assets/cultivation/textures/overlay/soil_tired.png

legend:
  . transparent
  a #9C8A6EB4   # pale loam crack (~70% alpha)
  b #B8A88CB4   # lighter loam highlight
  d #6E5F4A96   # darker crack shadow

grid:
  ..........a.....
  ........b.d.....
  .......a.a......
  ......adab......
  ab..aa...da..aba
  ..da.....a.ad...
  .........a......
  ..........b.....
  ..........a.....
  ...a.......a....
  ...d.......d....
  ..a.a......a....
  ..a.b.....a.....
  ..d.......ba....
  ..........ad....
  ..........d.....
